Phase 7 item 2 (write coordinator + run-N-variants) — E2E proof
Date: 2026-09-11  Commits: 3faa07c (item 1 conflict proof foundation), 50e5c61 (coordinator + variants)

Scope proven (through production dispatch CoreServices::handle, real SQLite store with v10 schema):
1. REQ-EV-0150 / QUAL-EV-0150 — overlapping writes denied BEFORE execution:
   task A acquires scope "src/api.rs" on the default repo; task B declaring
   "src/" is denied with the holder named ("write-set conflict with
   <task>: src/api.rs") and compensated to cancelled — no active
   reservation leaks. A disjoint declaration ("docs/") is admitted in
   parallel. Terminal holders free their ticket (release-on-acquire sweep
   + explicit release).
2. Coordinator is the single canonical live registry: spawn_agent
   admission (docs/14 step 3) now checks the same durable table; AgentFleet
   nodes carry the declaration as AgentGraph metadata only.
3. RunVariants (28): umbrella task + 3 admitted children all running,
   linked via parent_task_id; idempotent replay re-attaches (never
   doubles); count bounds (1,5) refuse before any task is minted.
4. Desktop composer: Variants selector (1-4) wired through the full
   bridge (encoder field 28 + varint count, handler, schema validation,
   preload, renderer).

